    "title": "Championship-winning Mt. Hood Community College softball gets 10 All-American scholars - NewsBreak",
    "text": "By Christopher Keizur ,\n9 hours ago A special group of Saints softballers aren’t just winning hardware on the field, they are also earning acclaim in the classroom. Mt. Hood Community College softball has earned national recognition by being named an Easton/NFCA Academic Team. That makes it one of only two colleges in the Northwest Athletic Conference to receive the honor. Read full article",
